{"id":"71326b2cdccfdfb4","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-shellable.md","title":"Shellable DNF","display":"df-shellable — Shellable DNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-shellable","aliases":["27-df-shellable"],"display":"df-shellable — Shellable DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-shelling]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-shellable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-shellable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shellable — Shellable DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45a8b0be7d3a8fde\" href=\"?note=45a8b0be7d3a8fde\" title=\"27-df-shelling\">27-df-shelling</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Shelling}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Shelling}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45a8b0be7d3a8fde\" href=\"?note=45a8b0be7d3a8fde\" title=\"27-df-shelling\">27-df-shelling</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\mathbf T\\;((\\mathbf T:[m]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}D)\\land\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\mathbf T\\;((\\mathbf T:[m]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}D)\\land\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §7.2.1, Definition 7.1，印刷页 330，PDF 第 354 页（从 1 计数）。 shellable 指存在一个满足原书差分块条件的顺序。它是表达式性质；这里不预设 D 为全正文字或全部素蕴涵项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-shelling","status":"resolved","id":"45a8b0be7d3a8fde","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-shelling]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-shelling","status":"resolved","id":"45a8b0be7d3a8fde","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Shelling}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-shelling]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Shelling}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\mathbf T\\;((\\mathbf T:[m]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}D)\\land\\mathrm{Shelling}_n(\\mathbf T))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1054,"backlinks":[{"id":"f210bb4dac8635d3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-shellable]]，$\\mathrm{PI}$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]，$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-monotone]]，$\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-monodnf]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-337","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-shellable|df-shellable — Shellable DNF]]"},{"id":"a12673cd8b86966e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$E\\subseteq\\{e\\subseteq N:|e|=2\\}$；$D_E$ 为下式构造的二次 DNF。$\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-shellable]]。下式定义 $\\bar E$ 与谓词 $\\mathrm{Chordal}$；$v_{r+1}=v_1$ 仅用于有限循环下标。"},{"id":"698a77a0557fd7dc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]；$\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n$, $T_L$, $C_L$ and $\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-shellable]], [[27-df-term]], [[27-df-clause]] and [[27-df-dual]]."},{"id":"63ee01e007c7ecd3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\cap\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n$ and $D\\ne\\varnothing$, using [[27-df-shellable]] and [[27-df-monodnf]]; $\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-dual]] and [[27-df-piset]]."}],"outgoing":["45a8b0be7d3a8fde","5d10aed668d85817","0b618255959ff4bc"]}